    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96706" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖδος</span>,
			ἡ,= foreg., gen. sg. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλεῖδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1703
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Rome</span>); acc. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλῖδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					425.7
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Phrygia</span>): 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυλίδα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.5.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.1.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
			number, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκίς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.95P.
			</span></i></div>
